sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Seller
  participant API as Seller / Partner API
  participant RR as Refund Reconciliation
  participant OB as Order Bridge
  participant LA as Lender Adapter
  participant RL as Repayment Ledger
  participant PO as Payment Orchestrator
  participant SS as Seller Settlement
  participant EV as Event Bus

  Seller->>API: Request full or partial refund
  API->>RR: Create refund with idempotency key
  RR->>OB: Validate delivered quantity and return state
  OB-->>RR: Refundable amount and seller reference
  RR->>LA: Request principal / schedule adjustment
  LA-->>RR: Lender adjustment reference
  RR->>RL: Refresh repayment projection
  alt Excess remains after lender adjustment
    RR->>PO: Refund excess to buyer payment source
    PO-->>RR: Payment refund reference
  end
  RR->>SS: Post seller reversal and fee adjustments
  SS-->>RR: Settlement entry posted
  RR->>EV: RefundReconciled event
  RR-->>API: Final refund allocation
  API-->>Seller: Lender, buyer and settlement breakdown
